  "description": "A pure managed .NET library for reading and writing Dolphin RVZ/WIA disc images and\n      decoding the legacy GameCube/Wii formats (GCZ, CISO/WBI, WBFS, TGC, NFS) to a canonical\n      ISO view. Written by Peterson Fernandes (Pure Logic Code); the RVZ/WIA format logic is\n      derived from Dolphin and the library is GPL-2.0-or-later, like Dolphin itself.",
